{
  "info": {
    "name": "Psicometría API - Evaluados (casos adicionales)",
    "description": "Casos complementarios a evaluados.postman_collection.json: normalización de datos, campos de solo lectura, conflictos y errores en PUT/DELETE.\n\nEjecutar en orden (Run collection); las últimas peticiones eliminan los evaluados creados.\n\nRequisitos: base psicometria_db creada con los scripts de database/ (incluye 03_datos_prueba.sql) y la API corriendo en {{baseUrl}}. Se puede usar con el environment evaluados-local.postman_environment.json.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "evaluadoId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "evaluadoEmail",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "evaluadoNormalizadoId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "evaluadoSoloLecturaId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Crear evaluado base",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('evaluadoId', body.id);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('evaluadoEmail', body.email);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"valentina.munoz.{{$timestamp}}@correo.cl\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Crear con email con espacios y mayúsculas (se normaliza)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Email sin espacios y en minúsculas', () => pm.expect(body.email).to.eql(body.email.trim().toLowerCase()));",
              "pm.test('Nombre sin espacios extremos', () => pm.expect(body.nombre).to.eql('Ignacio'));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('evaluadoNormalizadoId', body.id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"  Ignacio  \",\n  \"apellido\": \"Fuentes\",\n  \"email\": \"  IGNACIO.Fuentes.{{$timestamp}}@Correo.CL  \",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"NO_BINARIO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"TECNICO\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Crear ignorando id y fechas enviados (campos de solo lectura)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('El id lo asigna el servidor', () => pm.expect(body.id).to.not.eql(123456));",
              "pm.test('creadoAt lo asigna el servidor', () => pm.expect(body.creadoAt).to.not.include('2000-01-01'));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('evaluadoSoloLecturaId', body.id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"id\": 123456,\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"lectura.{{$timestamp}}@correo.cl\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"PREFIERO_NO_DECIR\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"POSTGRADO\",\n  \"activo\": true,\n  \"creadoAt\": \"2000-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Actualizar con el mismo email propio (200)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Apellido actualizado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().apellido).to.eql('Muñoz Tapia'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoId}}",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz Tapia\",\n  \"email\": \"{{evaluadoEmail}}\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
        },
        "description": "Reutiliza el email guardado en la petición 1: no debe considerarse duplicado consigo mismo."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Actualizar con email de otro evaluado (409)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 409', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
              "pm.test('Mensaje de duplicado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.include('camila.rojas@correo.cl'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoId}}",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"CAMILA.ROJAS@correo.cl\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
        },
        "description": "Usa el email de un evaluado de 03_datos_prueba.sql."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Actualizar id inexistente (404)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/999999",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"no.existe@correo.cl\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Actualizar con datos inválidos (400)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "const errores = pm.response.json().errores;",
              "pm.test('Errores en nombre, email y fechaNacimiento', () => {",
              "  ['nombre', 'email', 'fechaNacimiento'].forEach(c => pm.expect(errores).to.have.property(c));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoId}}",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"J\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"correo-invalido\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2999-12-31\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Crear con JSON malformado (400)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Pedro\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Lagos\",\n"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Crear con fecha en formato inválido (400)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Valentina\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"fecha.mala@correo.cl\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"15/08/2007\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Crear con nombre demasiado largo (400)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "pm.test('Error en nombre', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().errores).to.have.property('nombre'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Muñoz\",\n  \"email\": \"largo.{{$timestamp}}@correo.cl\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2007-08-15\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\",\n  \"nivelEducativo\": \"MEDIA\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "11. Eliminar id inexistente (404)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/999999"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "12. Eliminar con id no numérico (400)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/abc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "13. Limpieza: eliminar evaluado base",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoId}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "14. Limpieza: eliminar evaluado normalizado",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoNormalizadoId}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "15. Limpieza: eliminar evaluado de solo lectura",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evaluados/{{evaluadoSoloLecturaId}}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
